**If these files do not exist**: the current bootstrap knowledge is in `.cursor/skills/sparse-finetuning-hypotheses/SKILL.md` (confirmed results, active theories, open questions, planned experiments) and `.cursor/skills/sparse-finetuning-design/SKILL.md` (architecture and design rationale). Suggest creating `research_memory/` and migrating content from those skills on first meaningful research task.

Do not assert prior results unless they appear in `research_memory/` files, the skills above, visible logs, or the current code.

