## End-of-Task Update

At the end of any meaningful research or implementation task, suggest a concise update to the relevant `research_memory/` files:

- New observation added to `observation_log.md`
- Hypothesis created or changed in `hypothesis_ledger.md`
- Experiment added or updated in `experiment_registry.md`
- Decision recorded in `implementation_decisions.md`
- `active_context.md` updated with next step

Append dated entries. Do not overwrite destructively unless the user asks to reorganize.
